The site-worker at cloud.fcpublicmedia.org (merge once it answers)

**Merge only once `https://cloud.fcpublicmedia.org` answers**, or every form, claim, device, settings
and upload call goes to a name with no record.

- `site/_data/site_worker.yml` `url`: `https://cloud.fcpublicmedia.org`. Every page that talks to the
  worker reads this one line. The workers.dev address keeps answering (the Wix copy still uses it).

To make it answer, on digitization in a site-worker checkout:
`keys run cloudflare -- node bin/provision.mjs`. The zone is on the same account now, so it attaches
the Custom Domain; the token needs Zone Read, DNS Edit and Workers Routes Edit on fcpublicmedia.org.

Merge qualifications:
- [ ] `curl -s -X OPTIONS https://cloud.fcpublicmedia.org/answers -H 'Origin: https://www.fcpublicmedia.org' -H 'Access-Control-Request-Method: POST' -D -` shows `access-control-allow-origin`
- [ ] then deploy the site
